    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "撮影、お疲れ様\r\n最近の灯織は粘り強さがあってすごいな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日だって、ダメ押しの１テイクが採用されていたし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "本来なら、あれを最初から出せないと\r\n意味がないんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、ひとつひとつの仕事に、『やりきった』と\r\n言えるだけのことをしたいと思うようになって",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、それで『もう１テイク』だったんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい──あ、OKを出してくださる周りの人たちを\r\n信頼していないわけではないです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはもちろん、わかってるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2800
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "アイドルという枠以外の仕事も\r\nいただけるようになって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そういう仕事にも少し慣れてきて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "怖かったんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "怖い？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "全部のことに100％……いえ、それ以上の気持ちで\r\n当たれているのかという不安があって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……それを誰かに\r\n見透かされるんじゃないかって",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ファッション雑誌の撮影の頃か……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（灯織なりに葛藤があったんだな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だから、自分が納得できるまでやりきったら\r\n少しは不安を薄められるのかもと、思いまして",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだったのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。なので、プロデューサーの言うような\r\n粘り強さのような、ポジティブなものではないんですが……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、すごいことに変わりはないぞ！\r\n……もう大丈夫そうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね……正直まだ不安もありますし\r\nどの仕事でも悩みますけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201811/2002018110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018110180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──少しだけ踏み出せたような気がします",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
